---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: home
---
{% set latest = collections.articles[0] %}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="frame hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="label">Engineer · Project leader · Mentor</p>
      <h1 class="display"><span class="l1">Engineering and projects leader</span> <em><span class="nw">in <span class="nw2">the pharmaceutical</span></span> industry.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">I'm Abhay Inamdar. For over three decades I have designed, built and run pharmaceutical plants for companies like Dr. Reddy's, Amneal, Actavis and Aurobindo: sterile injectables, tablets, biologics and peptides, in India, the UAE and Europe.</p>
      <p class="hero-links">
        <a class="btn" href="/profile/">Read my profile {% include "arrow.njk" %}</a>
        <a class="btn quiet" href="{{ latest.url }}">Latest article <span class="dash">—</span> <em class="btn-title">{{ latest.data.short or latest.data.title }}</em></a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-figure">
      <div class="photo-frame">
        <img src="/images/abhay-inamdar.jpg" alt="Portrait of Abhay Inamdar" width="800" height="880">
      </div>
      <figcaption class="pill-caption">Abhay Inamdar</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="frame">
  <div class="feature-panel reveal">
    <div class="fp-text">
      <p class="label light">Right now</p>
      <h2>Immacule Lifesciences</h2>
      <p class="fp-sub">Vice President, Capital Projects &amp; Engineering</p>
      <p class="fp-body">Leading complex injectable and OSD projects from concept design to commissioning and qualification, with USFDA and EU Annex 1 compliance, automation and energy saving. Mentoring 250+ engineers across sites in Himachal Pradesh.</p>
      <p class="fp-links"><span class="fp-since">Since September 2025</span><a class="btn light" href="/profile/#immacule">What I do there {% include "arrow.njk" %}</a></p>
    </div>
    <ul class="fp-facts">
      {% for s in profile.stats %}
      <li><strong>{{ s.value }}</strong><span>{{ s.label }}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-career">
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="band-head reveal">
      <p class="label">Career</p>
      <h2>The companies that shaped my work.</h2>
      <p>Two stints at Dr. Reddy's, plants in India and the UAE, and projects in Italy, Ireland and Turkey.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reveal">{% include "marquee.njk" %}</div>
  <div class="frame">
    <p class="more"><a class="btn quiet" href="/profile/#experience">Read about each role {% include "arrow.njk" %}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-tint">
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="band-head reveal">
      <p class="label">Projects</p>
      <h2>Projects I have led.</h2>
      <p>New plants (greenfield), upgrades of running plants (brownfield) and regulatory fixes.</p>
    </div>
    {% set projectsLimit = 6 %}{% include "register.njk" %}
    <p class="more"><a class="btn quiet" href="/profile/#projects">See all {{ profile.projects.length }} projects {% include "arrow.njk" %}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="band-head reveal">
      <p class="label">Expertise</p>
      <h2>My areas of expertise.</h2>
      <p>The work I have done the most, and know best.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="skills">
      {% for e in profile.expertise %}
      <li class="card reveal">
        <span class="spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {% set icon = e.icon %}{% include "icon.njk" %}
        <h3>{{ e.area }}</h3>
        <p>{{ e.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-tint">
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="band-head reveal">
      <p class="label">Writing</p>
      <h2>Latest articles.</h2>
      <p>I write about aseptic design, compliance and running a plant well. These first appeared on LinkedIn.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="posts">
      {% for post in collections.articles | limit(3) %}
      <li class="reveal">
        <a class="card post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
          <span class="read-more">Read article {% include "arrow.njk" %}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="more"><a class="btn quiet" href="/articles/">See all {{ collections.articles.length }} articles {% include "arrow.njk" %}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
